## Unicode Character Database — `src/tables.zig`

`src/tables.zig` is generated by `tools/ucd_gen/gen.py` from the Unicode 17.0.0
files `UnicodeData.txt`, `SpecialCasing.txt`, `CaseFolding.txt`,
`DerivedNormalizationProps.txt`, `DerivedCoreProperties.txt` and
`extracted/DerivedNumericType.txt`, and compiled into the module (it is what
the case mappings, the normalization forms, `unaccent` and the classification
functions are computed from). It is a TRANSFORMED form of the data, not a copy
of the files: General_Category, Canonical_Combining_Class, quick-check values,
decompositions, composition pairs and case mappings are re-encoded as
three-stage lookup tables; the `unaccent` letter lists are derived by the
generator from the character NAMES in UnicodeData.txt. The Unicode License v3
permits modification; the notice below is reproduced because its clause (a)
asks that it appear with all copies of the Data Files.

## Unicode Character Database — `src/testdata/normalization_test.txt`

`src/testdata/normalization_test.txt` is `NormalizationTest.txt` of Unicode
17.0.0 with its comments and character descriptions removed (the test lines
themselves, in order, unchanged), written by `tools/ucd_gen/gen.py`. The same
licence and notice apply.

